  "prompt": "A quadratic function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nis a constant. The graph of\n[Figure 4]\nin the\n[Figure 5]\n-plane has its vertex at\n[Figure 6]\n, which is the maximum point of the function. If\n[Figure 7]\n, what is the value of\n[Figure 8]\n?",
